# `/curriculum/` was here and is deliberately gone (D-273, 2026-08-11).
#
# The history is worth keeping because the second fix was as wrong as the first. A bare
# `curriculum/` matched `packages/curriculum/` too - gitignore patterns are unanchored - and
# ruff respects .gitignore, so `ruff check .` silently stopped reading that whole Python
# package while `make lint` went green (D-240). But that line had never been committed: it
# was a local artifact, and anchoring it to `/curriculum/` committed an ignore of the
# *content* directory, which D-190 makes the versioned home for authored banks.
#
# Nothing wanted that. All 13 files under `curriculum/` were tracked anyway - git does not
# apply .gitignore to already-tracked files - so the rule was invisible until something new
# appeared there. C1 Phase 1 creates roughly 34 new authored YAML files by exactly that
# route: `make question-export` writes them, git would have ignored them, CI would never
# have seen them, and staging's loader would have found nothing. Removed rather than
# narrowed, because there is no local data under `curriculum/` to protect.

# S33: OWASP ZAP scan reports (make security-scan-staging) - local scan output, not
# something to commit.
zap-reports/

# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!terraform/environments/*/terraform.tfvars.example
# S35: saved plan files are zip archives with a full copy of tfstate inside them, so they
# carry every cleartext secret the state does (random_password results, secret_version
# strings). *.tfstate above was already ignored for exactly that reason; a plan file is
# the same payload under a different extension, and one was sitting untracked and
# committable in terraform/environments/staging when this was found.
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Outbound communication drafts - kept local, never committed (S36).
# Renamed + archived 2026-08-20 by the documentation migration; whether it is
# ever committed is UD-12(f), not decided by the rename.
docs/2026-07-24-org-asks-drafts.md
docs/archive/2026-07-24-org-asks-drafts.md

# S39: Playwright browser-audit output (console/network capture, traces, reports) -
